{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの自撮りいえい☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"65%笑顔っ(◎'ω`◎)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ誕生日だね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンレター以外に何かプレゼント送ってもいいかな?☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福山に住んでるので、バラとかどうかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キザすぎるかな(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バラ!いいねえキザだねえ(*'`*)嘘です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも本当に素敵!ひめたんバラ祭り行ったことあるよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントはおまかせしますよー☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜好き?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜すき＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜餅もすき。でもさくらんぼは普通...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送部にも全国大会あるんですね!!何を競い合って成績が決まるんですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人で朗読とアナウンス、団体でテレビ、ラジオ部門があります(^^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"燃えるんだよねこれがっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送部だったんだ!スピーチとかするのかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スピーチとはちょっと違うけど、毎日校内放送かけてましたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京ミッドタウン歩けるの?迷子にならない?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとりだったらよー歩かん('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"し、ひとりなら空気よんで引き返します多分...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年のときでも学級委員とかあったん?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校のクラスでのエピソードとかあったら教えてほしいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありましたよ!え3年生は学級委員ないのー(ω)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年4組はにぎやかなんです。ちゃんとしなきゃいけない時も。ありゃりゃ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボクシングしてる人ってどうですか?応援してくれますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボクシングわひゃああっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビとかで見てて、痛くないかな大丈夫かなって思ってたの('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気をつけてね!超応援する!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左胸はみーんな共感できる応援歌だから。頑張りたい時辛い時聴いてください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち上がる回数諦めるなっ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕企画どうだったかな?喜んでくれたらいいな!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当に嬉しかった!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんね、どなたかコメントに書いてくださったけど、4月生まれっていつも損するの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年クラス替えしてすぐが誕生日だから、みんな自分の誕生日を知らないじゃん..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今年はお祝いしてもらってTシャツも可愛くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な誕生日になりました(^^)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ13日なってないけど満足です//ぽ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイメロ好きですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイメロちゃん可愛いよね(*'`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤と白のおかおってだけで身につけたくなるもん♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今のふでばこぴんくマイメロちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにひめたんに手紙書こうかな?書いてほしい?笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙書きたいと思ったのですが、忙しいのに読んでもらえますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙超好きだよ書いてほしいもん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから毎日会う友達にも「お願いお手紙書いてー('`)」って言ってたなあ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもほんとに何の時間削ってでも読むよ//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなジュース何??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミキサーで作る(強調)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちごジュースばななジュース♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か楽器出来ますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴあの歴5年にして両手で弾けません。真面目に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソプラノリコーダー、音よれよれなけど一応 篠笛。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからタンバリンは感覚で演奏できる気がする!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボディパならかずみさん(高山一実chan)だね☆ぐるカーのPVでも披露したしねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リンクしてコメントしてるけど、たまにあたしたちのブログもみてますか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいのかなーて思って訪問したことなかったけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいの(o>ω<o)?じゃあ遊びに言っちゃうよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DDがばれるからだめよって人は先に申し出てくれないと知らないよー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndにもメンバーの映像が入るってほんと?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運営さんはうそなんかつきません(^ω^)!斯うご期待!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの家族はみんなシーフード無理なん??それともひめたんだけ??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんだけだねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままはシーフード大好きなのにアレルギーなの('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"47都道府県の中で、どこに行ったことありますか?どこの県が好きですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千葉、埼玉、東京、神奈川、静岡、愛知、富山、滋賀、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪、京都、岡山、鳥取、島根、山口、福岡。白地図参照!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年生の担任はどんな人でしたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体育科の女の先生!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今でもたまに連絡してくれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"活動したり東京で受験したり、中元さん面倒な生徒だったんですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最後まで支えてくれた素敵な先生です☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/10/6808044/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問したらどのくらいたったら答えてくれるの??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う...ごめんなさい...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できるだけタイムリーに答えられるよう努めます(ノω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばしお待ちをー☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}